WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.012
<v Theo>Welcome to Briefly, How It Works.

2
00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:08.103
<v Theo>I'm Theo, a computer-generated voice.

3
00:00:08.103 --> 00:00:10.852
<v Mira>And I'm Mira, also computer-generated.

4
00:00:10.852 --> 00:00:13.427
<v Mira>Today: what a compiler actually does.

5
00:00:13.427 --> 00:00:15.494
<v Theo>Good, because I write some code,

6
00:00:15.494 --> 00:00:17.999
<v Theo>press a button, and a program appears.

7
00:00:17.999 --> 00:00:19.715
<v Theo>What happens in between?

8
00:00:20.295 --> 00:00:22.236
<v Mira>A compiler is a translator.

9
00:00:22.236 --> 00:00:24.295
<v Mira>It takes the text you wrote and turns it

10
00:00:24.295 --> 00:00:26.860
<v Mira>into instructions a processor can run.

11
00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.068
<v Mira>First, it splits your text into small pieces

12
00:00:29.068 --> 00:00:32.456
<v Mira>called tokens: names, numbers, symbols.

13
00:00:32.456 --> 00:00:34.871
<v Theo>Like splitting a sentence into words.

14
00:00:34.871 --> 00:00:35.925
<v Mira>Exactly.

15
00:00:35.971 --> 00:00:38.668
<v Mira>Then it works out how those pieces fit together,

16
00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.824
<v Mira>and builds a tree that shows the structure of the program.

17
00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:43.795
<v Theo>And if I made a mistake?

18
00:00:43.795 --> 00:00:45.442
<v Mira>This is where you hear about it.

19
00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:47.922
<v Mira>The compiler checks the tree against the rules of

20
00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:50.797
<v Mira>the language, and reports what does not fit.

21
00:00:50.797 --> 00:00:52.443
<v Theo>And when everything fits?

22
00:00:52.443 --> 00:00:56.325
<v Mira>It can tidy the program, so it does the same job with less work.

23
00:00:56.325 --> 00:00:59.142
<v Mira>Then it writes out machine code for the CPU.

24
00:00:59.652 --> 00:01:01.623
<v Theo>So: split the text, build a tree,

25
00:01:01.623 --> 00:01:03.662
<v Theo>check it, tidy it, translate it.

26
00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:04.924
<v Mira>That's a compiler.

27
00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:06.293
<v Mira>Thanks for listening.
